stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> START_SELECTED: 第1次点击空闲块 (a)

    START_SELECTED --> HOVER_PREVIEW: 鼠标移到其他块 (b)
    START_SELECTED --> CONFIRMED: 第2次点击空闲块 (c)
    START_SELECTED --> IDLE: 点击已选块移除 (d)

    HOVER_PREVIEW --> CONFIRMED: 点击确认 (c)
    HOVER_PREVIEW --> IDLE: 点击已选块移除 (d)
    HOVER_PREVIEW --> BLOCKED: 预览区间碰到占用块

    BLOCKED --> HOVER_PREVIEW: 自动收缩至障碍前
    BLOCKED --> OVER_4H: 区间超过4小时

    OVER_4H --> IDLE: 阻断并提示最长4小时

    CONFIRMED --> IDLE: 点击任意处重新选择
    CONFIRMED --> START_SELECTED: 点击新空闲块 (e)

    state HOVER_PREVIEW {
        note1: 实时碰撞拦截
    }
    state BLOCKED {
        note2: 障碍阻断
    }
    state CONFIRMED {
        note3: emit select 事件
    }
